```mermaid
flowchart TD
    User[User Question]

    User --> Stage1[Stage 1: Nonsense Filter<br/>Regex Patterns]

    Stage1 -->|Pass| Stage2{Stage 2: Semantic Router<br/>Intent Classification}
    Stage1 -->|Block| Reject[Off-Domain Response<br/>Suggestion Chips]

    Stage2 -->|Accept 0.80+<br/>HARD_ACCEPT| Stage3[Stage 3: Pinecone Search<br/>Confidence Gating]
    Stage2 -->|Accept 0.40-0.79<br/>SOFT_ACCEPT| Stage3
    Stage2 -->|Reject <0.40| Reject
    Stage2 -->|Synthesis| SynthResponse[Generate Narrative<br/>No Search]

    Stage3 -->|Score ≥0.25| Stage4[Stage 4: Entity Detection<br/>Story Pinning]
    Stage3 -->|Score <0.20| NoResults[No Strong Matches<br/>Suggestion Chips]

    Stage4 --> Stage5[Stage 5: Intent Ranking<br/>Context Isolation]

    Stage5 --> Response[AI Response<br/>GPT-4o]

    Response --> Sources[Source Citations<br/>Match Confidence]
    Response --> RelatedProj[Related Projects]
    Response --> FollowUp[Follow-up Question]

    FollowUp --> User

    style User fill:#8B5CF6,color:#fff
    style Stage2 fill:#6366F1,color:#fff
    style Response fill:#3498DB,color:#fff
    style Reject fill:#E74C3C,color:#fff
    style NoResults fill:#E74C3C,color:#fff
